# DOX Framework Router

Canon: `AGENTS.md` § Workflow & DOX. Detail: `documents/agent-workflows/workflow-phases.md` § Workflow + DOX · `dox-framework.md`.

## Hard rule

DOX hooks into workflow phases — read chain before implement; DOX pass at verify (with validation), not as a separate phase.

## Read before editing

1. Root `AGENTS.md` + every `AGENTS.md` on path to each target
2. Nearest doc = local contract; parents = repo-wide rules
3. Closer doc wins local details; child cannot weaken parent DOX
4. Re-read in session — do not rely on memory

## Update after editing

DOX pass when change affects purpose, scope, contracts, workflows, permissions, child index, or user preferences. Update parents when structure shifts. Remove stale text.

## Child doc shape

Purpose · Ownership · Local Contracts · Work Guidance · Verification · Child DOX Index. Create child when folder is a durable boundary.

## Closeout

At **verify**: validation + DOX pass (update owning `AGENTS.md` if contracts changed). Top-level index: root `AGENTS.md` only.

